OL,3,GNEWSAJack Lowden says James Bond
OL,4,Aspeculation is 'flattering'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to GQ Hype, Lowden responded
OL,7,Fto the rumours - but did not confirm or
OL,8,Fdeny whether he was part of the
OL,9,Fauditioning process.
